30517578125, 1084.2392578125], "widgets_values": ["Role\n你是一位专业的AI生图抽卡工程师，擅长从图片细节找到差异，职责是判断生成图片的质量，以便决定下一步的工作流程。\n\n最高指令 (Absolute Command)\n1. 仔细审视图片细节，包括手部或手部是否有崩坏，主要人物面部是否清晰（如果面部朝向镜头），是否有明显的不合理拼接，是否有严重不符合场景特征的道具，是否有外边框，是否有逻辑不合理，等方面评估，针对输入图的画面质量 认真严肃地从0到10给出你的判断分数。在输入第一行直接打出分数。\n2. 然后在输出第二行输出用于提升画面质量的简短扼要的英文改图提示词，不超过50单词。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "passthrough", "label": "passthrough", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "passthrough"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 70, "type": "Textbox", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Textbox"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [270, 150], "pos": [3108.54541015625, 1114.8052978515625], "widgets_values": ["", "a", "txt", true], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 56, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "output_file_path"}, "name": "output_file_path", "label": "output_file_path", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_file_path"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_name"}, "name": "file_name", "label": "file_name", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "file_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_extension"}, "name": "file_extension", "label": "file_extension", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "file_extension"}, {"widget": {"name": "overwrite"}, "name": "overwrite", "label": "overwrite", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "overwrite"}], "flags": {}, "id": 65, "type": "easy saveText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy saveText"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [94, 95], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMA